---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="projects" title="Project Events" active="project-events" pageMark="🏗️">
  The decision pop-ups that fire when a city finishes a production <strong>Project</strong>. Two kinds:
  <strong>one-time building projects</strong> — the <a href={`${base}urban-improvements`}>Archive</a>, Forum,
  Walls, Treasury, Sangam and Opulence each fire one specific decision, much like a
  <a href={`${base}wonder-events`}>wonder event</a>; and <strong>repeatable projects</strong> —
  the Festival, Hunt and Olympiad are event generators, rolling one story from a weighted pool every
  time you run them (Festivals draw on the largest pool). Each card shows what triggers it and what
  every choice grants. As elsewhere, the weights are the XML knob, not real in-game odds — character
  and empire conditions filter which stories are actually eligible.
</EventGroupPage>
